+    });
+    /**
+     * @target AvalancheFeeRuntime.collect rejects invalid %s without RPC
+     * @dependencies Real AvalancheFeeRuntime and fee/RPC validation; config and input
+     *  builders; vi.fn transport and setChainConfig sink
+     * @scenario
